db66994787e6fb47b","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-19T09:00:06Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T09:00:10Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/laleoarrow/battery-monitor/releases/download/v4.3.23/Wattson-v4.3.23-macos-universal.pkg"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/laleoarrow/battery-monitor/releases/assets/655755603","id":655755603,"node_id":"RA_kwDOS6q1MM4nFglT","name":"Wattson-v4.3.23-release-info.txt","label":"","uploader":{"login":"laleoarrow","id":127536391,"node_id":"U_kgDOB5oNBw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127536391?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/laleoarrow","html_url":"https://github.com/laleoarrow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laleoarrow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laleoarrow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laleoarrow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laleoarrow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laleoarrow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laleoarrow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laleoarrow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laleoarrow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laleoarrow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","state":"uploaded","size":395,"digest":"sha256:b417bda65d808bc9bee8e070d8f7480f2c336458c93da152e838db4bdab5004b","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-19T09:00:06Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T09:00:06Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/laleoarrow/battery-monitor/releases/download/v4.3.23/Wattson-v4.3.23-release-info.txt"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/laleoarrow/battery-monitor/tarball/v4.3.23","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/laleoarrow/battery-monitor/zipball/v4.3.23","body":"# Wattson 4.3.23\n\n本次为性能与稳定性维护更新，保留现有界面、功能、配色、设置和 Activity Score 计算方式。\n\n- 减少 Process Activity 操作按钮的重复图像刷新。\n- 进程排名刷新时保留当前进程的键盘焦点，避免焦点跳到另一行或打断其他输入控件。\n- 修复 helper 在空闲截止时间已到、采样任务尚未结束时可能出现的无等待轮询，保留原有采样节奏与退出策略。\n- 更新 Xcode 27 工具链兼容处理及测试清理逻辑。\n\n源代码已通过 macOS 27.0.1 / Xcode 27 的 Swift、Python、三种原生 AppKit 交互策略、动画压力测试与 Universal 构建验证。该兼容验证不等同于所有 macOS 27 场景均无缺陷，也不代表测得整机性能或能耗提升。\n\nActivity Score 表示 CPU 与空闲唤醒活动，**不是实测功耗或电池耗电比例**。当前界面可参考沿用的 [4.3.22 设计预览](https://laleoarrow.github.io/battery-monitor/design/v4.3.22/)。\n\n## 安装\n\n支持 Apple Silicon 和 Intel，最低 macOS 12。\n\n- [完整 PKG](https://github.com/laleoarrow/battery-monitor/releases/download/v4.3.23/Wattson-v4.3.23-macos-universal.pkg)：同步更新 App、helper 与安装记录，适合现有 PKG / Homebrew 用户。\n- [只读 DMG](https://github.com/laleoarrow/battery-monitor/releases/download/v4.3.23/Wattson-v4.3.23-macos-universal.dmg)：仅含 App，不安装 helper；不提供进程采样与需 helper 的控制功能。\n- Homebrew：`brew install --cask laleoarrow/tap/wattson`，已有安装可用 `brew upgrade --cask wattson`。\n\nCommunity 分发：App / helper 为 ad-hoc 签名；PKG / DMG 未签名、未公证。请核对发布来源与随附 SHA256SUMS.txt，macOS 的信任检查仍适用。\n\n## 验证记录\n\n- [冻结发布源码](https://github.com/laleoarrow/battery-monitor/commit/23185f299ce61b8e373ebf5115b461ad2aa01226)\n- [发布提交 Headless CI](https://github.com/laleoarrow/battery-monitor/actions/runs/39218951312)：Swift 664 项、Python 613 项（4 项按配置跳过）及网站检查通过。\n- [候选安装包与五平台安装验证](https://github.com/laleoarrow/battery-monitor/actions/runs/39220053878)\n- [macOS 27 兼容验证](https://github.com/laleoarrow/battery-monitor/actions/runs/39198225803)：运行时代码与本版相同，版本与文档后续更新。\n"}